---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { COMPANY_NAME } from '../lib/config';
---

<Layout>
  <!-- About Me Section -->
  <section id="about" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
    <h1 id="about-heading">About Me</h1>

    <!-- Ionic Grid -->
    <ion-grid>
      <ion-row>
        <!-- Portrait Image -->
        <ion-col size="12" size-lg="5">
          <div class="ion-text-center">
            <img
              src={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}assets/images/about/portrait.png`}
              alt={`Portrait of ${COMPANY_NAME}`}
              aria-describedby="image-info"
            >
            <span class="aria-hide" id="image-info">
              Portrait of {COMPANY_NAME}
            </span>
          </div>
        </ion-col>

        <!-- Text Content -->
        <ion-col size="12" size-lg="7">
          <p>
            Hello, my name is {COMPANY_NAME}, as a digital designer and photographer, I have a deep passion for blending creativity with technical skill. I thrive on capturing moments and crafting visual experiences that tell a unique story. Whether through stunning photography or innovative design, I aim to transform ideas into engaging visuals that leave a lasting impact. Every project is an opportunity for me to explore new ways to communicate and connect through the power of design.
          </p>
          <p class="w3-margin-top">
            In my experience working with professionals across various fields—such as healthcare, legal services, education, and more. I’ve had the opportunity to create and edit a diverse range of visual content designed to meet the specific needs of each industry.
          </p>
          <p>
            Whether it's designing marketing materials, enhancing website visuals, or producing high-quality photos for portfolios or promotional campaigns, I understand the importance of creating work that is both professional and engaging. From legal consultants to wellness experts, I collaborate closely with my clients to ensure that their unique expertise and values are clearly communicated through compelling visuals. By focusing on precision, clarity, and a polished aesthetic, I help strengthen their professional image and build trust with their audience.
          </p>
        </ion-col>
      </ion-row>
    </ion-grid>

  </section> <!-- End About Me -->
</Layout>


<style>

/* ABOUT */
#about img {
  width: 60%;
  margin: 2rem 0 3rem;
}

/* MEDIA QUERIES */
@media only screen and (min-width: 48.0625rem) {

  /* ABOUT */
  #about img {
    width: 50%;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }
}

  /* ---------------------------------------------------------
   MOBILE
--------------------------------------------------------- */
@media screen and (max-width: 37.5rem) {
  
  /* About profile image */
  #about img {
    width: 80%;
    margin: 0.75rem auto 1.5rem;
    display: block;
  }

  /* About text */
  #about p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    letter-spacing: 0.09rem;
  }
}


/* ---------------------------------------------------------
   MOBILE TYPOGRAPHY
--------------------------------------------------------- */
@media screen and (max-width: 600px) {

  #about p {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    letter-spacing: 0.06rem !important;
  }

  /* Paragraph spacing */
  #home p + p,
  #about p + p {
    margin-top: 1.25rem;
  }
}

/* ---------------------------------------------------------
   SMALL MOBILE DEVICES
--------------------------------------------------------- */
@media screen and (max-width: 375px) {

  #about p {
    font-size: 0.8125rem; /* 13px */
    line-height: 1.6;
    letter-spacing: 0.04rem !important;
  }
}

</style>
